00:26:10.585 --> 00:26:12.585
If there is a next life,

00:26:13.605 --> 00:26:16.465
I hope it's an even better one for you.

00:26:47.225 --> 00:26:48.065
Mm.

00:27:02.265 --> 00:27:03.265
I'm done praying.

00:27:04.825 --> 00:27:05.825
You are?

00:27:10.745 --> 00:27:11.825
Why are you crying?

00:27:45.065 --> 00:27:47.265
I'd better charge you rent at this rate.

00:27:49.625 --> 00:27:51.825
How could you? This isn't yours.

00:28:02.585 --> 00:28:04.465
I'm truly sorry for Pa'Porn.

00:28:10.265 --> 00:28:11.825
She's at peace now,

00:28:14.065 --> 00:28:15.465
and so is your dad.

00:28:18.825 --> 00:28:20.665
They're probably in a better place.

00:28:31.145 --> 00:28:33.345
This is the book I always read to him.

00:28:36.025 --> 00:28:39.025
I chose this one
because the story is so long,

00:28:41.705 --> 00:28:44.985
hoping he'd at least make it

00:28:45.505 --> 00:28:46.985
to the final volume.

00:28:51.785 --> 00:28:53.285
But in the end, he couldn't make it.

00:28:55.825 --> 00:28:57.505
You've already done
a good job, you know?

00:28:59.865 --> 00:29:01.345
If I were you...

00:29:04.145 --> 00:29:05.625
I wouldn't know

00:29:06.665 --> 00:29:08.345
how strong I could stay.

00:29:09.225 --> 00:29:10.625
Someone like you

00:29:11.465 --> 00:29:12.985
would probably be the strongest here.

00:29:16.505 --> 00:29:17.825
You know?

00:29:18.785 --> 00:29:20.985
When I first came here,

00:29:22.385 --> 00:29:23.785
I always got picked on.

00:29:31.505 --> 00:29:33.305
I had nobody on my side,

00:29:35.865 --> 00:29:37.505
not even someone to talk to.

00:29:39.505 --> 00:29:40.505
I had no one.

00:29:44.505 --> 00:29:46.105
At least I had Pa'Porn.

00:29:48.145 --> 00:29:49.865
She always cheered me up.

00:29:52.345 --> 00:29:55.345
She took care of me
as if we were a family.

00:29:56.885 --> 00:29:58.545
I couldn't imagine

00:29:59.285 --> 00:30:01.185
what my life would be

00:30:01.865 --> 00:30:03.225
without her.

00:30:12.425 --> 00:30:14.225
What about your actual family?

00:30:39.185 --> 00:30:40.985
It's okay
if you don't want to talk about it.

00:30:53.145 --> 00:30:54.625
My parents and I...

00:30:56.305 --> 00:30:57.865
We aren't that close.

00:31:00.665 --> 00:31:02.905
I wasn't the one they were proud of,

00:31:05.605 --> 00:31:07.305
unlike my younger sister.

00:31:16.545 --> 00:31:17.865
You have a younger sister, too?

00:31:19.425 --> 00:31:20.225
Mm.

00:31:22.465 --> 00:31:23.865
Her name was Cream.

00:31:25.425 --> 00:31:27.025
She changed it to Natty.

00:31:30.025 --> 00:31:32.105
We have nothing in common,

00:31:34.225 --> 00:31:35.465
except for how we look.

00:31:39.245 --> 00:31:41.125
That probably means she's pretty.

00:31:48.765 --> 00:31:50.025
If she pays you a visit,

00:31:50.265 --> 00:31:51.265
please tell me, okay?

00:31:53.145 --> 00:31:54.145
I'd like to have a look at her.

00:31:58.825 --> 00:31:59.945
She's not coming.

00:32:03.385 --> 00:32:05.185
When I was thrown into prison,

00:32:10.305 --> 00:32:12.265
my family suffered a lot.

00:32:14.505 --> 00:32:16.065
The teacher who was killed

00:32:17.065 --> 00:32:18.585
was loved by many.

00:32:23.545 --> 00:32:26.185
So, my sister suffered the most

00:32:28.025 --> 00:32:30.145
because her own sister
was the murderer.

00:32:32.425 --> 00:32:34.745
You told her not to visit you, right?

00:32:36.945 --> 00:32:39.785
I don't want her life to be ruined.

00:32:55.325 --> 00:32:56.705
Claire, can I ask you something?

00:33:03.985 --> 00:33:05.865
Why did you kill that teacher?

00:33:11.425 --> 00:33:13.425
For what he did to my sister,

00:33:18.325 --> 00:33:20.125
he deserved to die.

00:33:22.025 --> 00:33:24.225
You weren't there
to steal a computer, right?

00:33:29.225 --> 00:33:31.025
If my sister were thrown in jail,

00:33:32.985 --> 00:33:34.985
I'm sure she wouldn't make it.

00:33:39.285 --> 00:33:41.085
I wanted to protect her.

00:33:49.465 --> 00:33:51.065
Was she the one
who killed the teacher?

00:33:57.745 --> 00:33:59.345
I promised her that

00:34:01.345 --> 00:34:03.545
this would be our secret,

00:34:05.105 --> 00:34:06.605
and it shouldn't be told to anyone.

00:34:11.745 --> 00:34:13.345
You also have to promise me, okay?

00:34:42.505 --> 00:34:44.625
Why are you telling me this?

00:35:01.305 --> 00:35:02.905
Because you're the first

00:35:05.345 --> 00:35:07.025
and only one I trust.

00:38:10.045 --> 00:38:11.845
This is my first time.

00:38:18.625 --> 00:38:19.905
It's okay if you're not ready.

00:39:12.945 --> 00:39:14.025
I already told you

00:39:14.345 --> 00:39:15.705
that this isn't our home.

00:39:16.185 --> 00:39:18.025
You can't just enter the room
whenever you like.

00:39:21.185 --> 00:39:23.665
The nurse reported that
Pa'Porn didn't die of heart failure,

00:39:23.705 --> 00:39:24.945
but from an overdose.

00:39:24.985 --> 00:39:25.705
Listen...

00:39:27.225 --> 00:39:28.825
You're not quitting, are you?

00:39:29.005 --> 00:39:30.865
At least her relatives

00:39:30.905 --> 00:39:33.495
should've been informed
about her actual cause of death.

00:39:41.745 --> 00:39:42.745
Do you know that

00:39:43.345 --> 00:39:45.345
since Pa'Porn arrived here,

00:39:46.505 --> 00:39:48.255
how many of her relatives
have come to see her?

00:39:52.185 --> 00:39:53.785
None.

00:39:54.585 --> 00:39:56.785
She was just an inmate
with no family who died.

00:39:57.405 --> 00:39:58.745
No matter the cause,

00:39:59.245 --> 00:40:01.245
nobody even cares.

00:40:02.265 --> 00:40:04.105
Why are we having the prison

00:40:04.345 --> 00:40:05.865
investigated over this?

00:40:06.225 --> 00:40:07.745
This is about someone's life, Dad.

00:40:09.985 --> 00:40:11.465
Porches! Porches! Porches!

00:40:12.945 --> 00:40:14.745
She was already dead.

00:40:15.245 --> 00:40:17.305
Those of us who are alive
have to keep going.

00:40:18.485 --> 00:40:19.685
So this is

00:40:19.985 --> 00:40:21.865
what you mean by

00:40:21.905 --> 00:40:23.005
learning to play the game?

00:40:50.705 --> 00:40:52.505
You went to Bell's dad's funeral?

00:40:55.065 --> 00:40:56.065
How did you know?

00:40:57.945 --> 00:40:59.745
You haven't been
on social media, right?

00:41:06.625 --> 00:41:07.625
[He said he broke up with her,
yet they are still seeing each other]

00:41:07.665 --> 00:41:08.665
[Maybe not!
I saw them arguing by the crematory]

00:41:09.025 --> 00:41:09.905
[There goes Top, my idol...
What a failure]

00:41:09.945 --> 00:41:10.825
[Bastard]

00:41:11.265 --> 00:41:12.106
[Someone like us
wouldn't get out of jail like she did]

00:41:12.146 --> 00:41:12.985
[Both father and son are just as bad]

00:41:15.905 --> 00:41:18.385
I know you want to help
your girlfriend,

00:41:19.425 --> 00:41:20.665
but think it through.

00:41:21.865 --> 00:41:24.705
Right now, your life is
pretty much perfect, you know?

00:41:25.585 --> 00:41:26.865
You've got good looks

00:41:27.925 --> 00:41:29.225
and wealth.

00:41:29.865 --> 00:41:31.305
Everybody respects you.

00:41:32.185 --> 00:41:33.425
You've got everything, man.

00:41:33.665 --> 00:41:35.225
I'm even jealous of you.

00:41:39.565 --> 00:41:40.785
But right now...

00:41:41.505 --> 00:41:43.065
You're putting everything on the line

00:41:43.105 --> 00:41:44.305
just to save her,

00:41:44.505 --> 00:41:46.505
