00:42:57.305 --> 00:42:58.985
By the way, Bell...

00:43:00.225 --> 00:43:02.425
Whatever I did in the past,

00:43:03.025 --> 00:43:04.825
let's just move on, okay?

00:43:07.505 --> 00:43:09.065
